        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kwibūlaga mu būlūgū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a Bafilisiti bamba būlūgū kwilwisha na a Baisilaeli; a Baisilaeli būbapeela a Bafilisiti, bingī babo būgwa mu lūgūlū lwa Giliboa, būchīla kwenūko! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti būng'wisonja ū Saulo na a bitūnja bakwe, būbabūlaga a bitūnja bakwe, ū Yonasani, Abinadabu nū Malikishua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būlūgū būnshitīlīja ū Saulo, balasi būng'wihuuta būnasa masonga būnabūla kībi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe, “Bebe sopoolaga ī līlūshū lyako ūnimalīīje, batiziza kūnimalīja a bing'wana abo batasaalilwe benaba bakūniiguusīja noi!” Alīyo ū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe ūlema ū kūmūlaga, nguno akogoha; na lūūlū ū Saulo ūlīsola ī līlūshū lyakwe ūlītega, hūna ūlīgwīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe aho wabona gīkī ū ise būgonzo waacha, nang'hwe ūlīgwīla ī lyakwe ūchīlanīja hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Saulo na a bitūnja bakwe a badatū, nū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe, hamò na a banhū bakwe būcha lūshikū lūmò lwenūlo pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli abo baalī bazengile ū mu sī ya ntubīlo na a ba kū ntambūko gwa Yolodani aho babona lyapeela ī libità lya Baisilaeli, bīgwa nī gīkī ū Saulo wachaaga na a bitūnja bakwe a badatū, bīpeela ī mizengo yabo. Bafilisiti biza kwikala moi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ntondo yaho a Bafilisiti aho biza kūsola ī shikolo sha banhū abo baalī baabūlagwa, būnsanga ū Saulo mu lūgūlū lwa Giliboa, achiile hamò na a bitūnja bakwe a badatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būntīna ū ntwe gwakwe, nī shilanga shakwe būshisola; hūna būtūma banhū pye a hose ū mu sī ya Bafilisiti, kūjikumūcha ī ng'hūlū jenījo ū mu hekalu ja bamulungu babo nū kū banhū babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilanga shakwe būshitūūla mu hekalu ya Maashiteloti, ū mīlī gwakwe būgūkomeela ha ndugu ya Beti-shani, gūdamīīla henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū ba Yabeshi-gileadi aho bigwa īyo bakagwītīla ū mīlī go ng'wa Saulo a Bafilisiti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pye a banhū babo a bagoosha ba mbagashūūla, būbūūka ī būjikū yenīyo būja ko ī Beti-shani. Būūkīyicha a ha ndugu ya Beti-shani ī mibīlī yenīyo, ū go ng'wa Saulo nī ya bitūnja bakwe, bīsola būja nayo Yabeshi būūkīpemba mu moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a maguha būgasola būgajīka ha sīlīlī ya nshishi ū mu Yabeshi ng'wenūmo; hanuma būfunga shikū mpungatī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
